(Chapter 4: Classical Mechanics and Dynamics) Tj
T* (Section 4.1: Newtons Second Law of Motion) Tj
T* (Newtons Second Law states that the net force acting on an object equals its mass multiplied by its acceleration.) Tj
T* (Formula: F = m * a, where F is net force in Newtons \(N\), m is mass in kilograms \(kg\), and a is acceleration in m/s^2.) Tj
T* (The SI unit of force is the Newton \(N\), defined as 1 kg*m/s^2.) Tj
ET
endstream
